name 'ai-and-algorithmic-decisions-postassessment-q11_2026'

question 'A streaming service shows a "Spoiler Alert" image only if the user has BOTH not finished the movie AND the page has spoiler tags turned on. What structure best handles this logic?'

wrong 'A single if statement with no else branch.'
wrong 'Two separate functions called one after the other.'
wrong 'A variable that stores the spoiler text.'
right 'A nested conditional — one if statement inside another — so both conditions are checked in sequence.'

allow_multiple_attempts true

